{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ecg.dart:offset-26417", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ecg.dart", "location": "offset-26417", "text": "'Analyse my ECG reading $id. Use get_ecg_reading. Start with signal '\n'quality and the band-reported result, then read the waveform itself — '\n'rate, rhythm and its regularity, intervals and morphology — and give '\n'your impression. Say where the trace or its unproven polarity does not '\n'support a reading, and say so if you disagree with the band.'", "sha256": "0906d167710a599c7febf20436bdc321d99ef40759743f9f13ba0dd187e3e2ba", "kind": "dart", "start": 26417, "end": 26784, "line": 778}
